  baslikEn: "I. VIRTUE \u2014 TEMPERANCE"
  icerikEn: '"Do not try to grasp everything at once, my love... The eye that pauses
    to breathe and walks with measure sees the truth behind the stones."'
  etkilesimMesafesi: 1.75
