  tur: 0
  kayitKodu: bolum1_gunah_oburluk
  erdemSirasi: 1
  baslikTr: "I. G\xDCNAH \u2014 OBURLUK"
  icerikTr: "Hi\xE7bir k\u0131r\u0131nt\u0131y\u0131 geride b\u0131rakmamak i\xE7in
    ta\u015Flar\u0131n \xE7\xF6k\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFC bile g\xF6rmezden geldim. Doymak
    bilmeyen bu tela\u015F, hem beni hem onu bu derinli\u011Fe \xE7ekti."
  baslikEn: "I. SIN \u2014 GLUTTONY"
  icerikEn: Refusing to leave a single crumb behind, I ignored even the crumbling
    stones beneath me. This insatiable rush dragged both me and her into these depths.
  etkilesimMesafesi: 1.75
